      "level": "medium",
      "reason": "EU law requires the warning: may have an adverse effect on activity and attention in children.",
      "terms": [
        "e102", "tartrazine", "tartrazin",
        "e104", "quinoline yellow", "chinolingelb", "jaune de quinoleine",
